     0087             (    ../defs/os9.d):00821         M$ID1               EQU       $87                 Module ID code byte one
     00CD             (    ../defs/os9.d):00822         M$ID2               EQU       $CD                 Module ID code byte two
     87CD             (    ../defs/os9.d):00823         M$ID12              EQU       M$ID1*256+M$ID2
                      (    ../defs/os9.d):00824         
